; A mouse-only game on the DualSense: the left stick moves the pointer,
; Cross clicks, Circle right-clicks and Square middle-clicks. Options sends
; Enter, which confirms the launcher dialog many mouse games open first (Unity's
; resolution dialog, for one). Share it with any profile whose game is played
; with the mouse alone.
[input]
mode = keyboard
mouse = left_stick
mouse_speed = 900
cross = mouse_left
circle = mouse_right
square = mouse_middle
r2 = mouse_left
l2 = mouse_right
options = enter
